   "source": [
    "9. (a)\n",
    "odds = 0.37\n",
    "=> p(x)/(1-p(x)) = 0.37\n",
    "=> p(x) = 0.37 - 0.37*p(x)\n",
    "=> p(x) = 0.37/1.37 = 0.27\n",
    "\n",
    "So, approximately 27 % of people defaults with odds of 0.37"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "5876df31-2909-49fe-b454-1be6e21443df",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "(b) p(x) = 0.16\n",
    "odds = p(x)/(1-p(x)) = 0.16/0.84 = 0.19\n",
    "so odds of defaulting is 0.19"
   ]
  }
